meta {
  name: Add Item to Cart
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/cart
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "productId": "{{productId}}",
    "variantId": "{{variantId}}",
    "quantity": 1
  }
}

docs {
  ## POST /api/cart

  Adds an item to the authenticated customer's cart.
  **Upserts** — if the same `productId + variantId` pair already exists,
  `quantity` is incremented rather than creating a duplicate.

  ### Body
  | Field     | Type    | Required | Description                         |
  |-----------|---------|----------|-------------------------------------|
  | productId | string  | ✅       | Prisma ID of the product            |
  | variantId | string  | ✅       | Prisma ID of the specific variant   |
  | quantity  | integer | ❌       | Units to add, defaults to `1`       |

  ### Error Responses
  | Status | Description                                               |
  |--------|-----------------------------------------------------------|
  | 401    | Customer not authenticated                                |
  | 404    | Variant not found or doesn't belong to product            |
  | 409    | Item out of stock or requested quantity exceeds stock     |
  | 410    | Product is no longer active (discontinued)                |

  ### Success (201)
  ```json
  { "cartItem": { "id": "...", "quantity": 1, ... } }
  ```
}
